{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Large Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Say hello to a dog who's looking for his people! This handsome 1-year-old is sweet, friendly, and housebroken. He's a great listener too, and picks up on direction like a champ.\nHis favorite things in life? Walks, runs, belly rubs, epic games of fetch, and snack time - especially when pumpkin yogurt or apple slices are involved.\nA few fun facts to know: he's a bit of an escape artist (outsmarted his crate - quite impressive) and prefers to have his people close by. He can get nervous or startled by unexpected noises like a hair dryer or a trash can on the move. Nothing a little patience and reassurance can't handle! He'll express his appreciation with snuggles, kisses and lots of love and be your fur-ever friend.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=4&searchType=4&animalid=204639","id":"6003948d27a3ac53809704a6a8df9e3d","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/aa71e877d1144b51998b749386c62069-1788444532-1789414065-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/34802b5dcfff47bda4d792b72e6c8255-1788444536-1788444536-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e72a47d6207340bfa0f0b26023e6c102-1788444535-1788444535-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/32e28b87710e43e6bc87c14750684630-1788444534-1788444534-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/7d1d69e09d02418883aa5d645925f5d0-1788444533-1788444533-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/84d3936d4d764a508873453322166b53-1788444531-1788444531-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/abc1859ee5da491f83651e8ecec726ce-1788444530-17884445